{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_28392","headline":"题茶山 · 杜牧","name":"题茶山","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"山实东吴秀，茶称瑞草魁。\n剖符虽俗吏，修贡亦仙才。\n溪尽停蛮櫂，旗张卓翠苔。\n柳村穿窈窕，松涧渡喧豗。\n等级云峰峻，宽平洞府开。\n拂天闻笑语，特地见楼台。\n泉嫩黄金涌，牙香紫璧裁。\n拜章期沃日，轻骑疾奔雷。\n舞袖岚侵涧，歌声谷答回。\n磬音藏叶鸟，雪艳照潭梅。\n好是全家到，兼爲奉诏来。\n树阴香作帐，花径落成堆。\n景物残三月，登临怆一盃。\n重游难自尅，俛首入尘埃。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杜牧","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_28392.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_28392","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}